  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Plum?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Plum.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033810\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Plum\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Plum</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crop</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 94</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 82</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1 d 1 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 16</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/plum-tree-29905\" title=\"Plum Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum Tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 23</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 16</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Plums</b> are fruit <a href=\"/wiki/crops-3568\" title=\"Crops\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">crops</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 94. They grow on <a href=\"/wiki/plum-tree-29905\" title=\"Plum Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">plum trees</a> and can be harvested four times.\n</p><p>They were introduced on 25th June 2018.\n</p><p>They are used as ingredients for <a href=\"/wiki/plum-jam-29907\" title=\"Plum Jam\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">plum jam</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/plum-smoothie-29911\" title=\"Plum Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">plum smoothies</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/rice-ball-34694\" title=\"Rice Ball\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">rice balls</a>. \n</p><p>Like all crops, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">silo</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting plums</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/wiki/plum-tree-29905\" title=\"Plum tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Plum tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The first harvest gives two plums, the second one three, and the other two four. After the third harvest the tree wilts.\n</p><p>Tapping on the tree places a sign on it letting other players know the tree needs to be revived. Once it is, a last harvest can be done before the tree dies. A <a href=\"/wiki/saw-2924\" title=\"Saw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">saw</a> is then required to cut it.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling plums</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143054\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Roadside shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Roadside shop</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>Plums can be sold or bought for a maximum price of 828 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 plums.</li>\n<li>Buying a plum tree costs 600 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li>\n<li>Given all 13 plums are collected during the four harvests, the batch can be sold for 1,076 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>, thus giving a profit of 476 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> per tree.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using plums</b></span></h3>\n<p>Plums are used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/plum-jam-29907\" title=\"Plum jam\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum jam\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/plum-smoothie-29911\" title=\"Plum smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum smoothie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/rice-ball-34694\" title=\"Rice ball\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rice ball\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/plum-jam-29907\" title=\"Plum Jam\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plum Jam</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/plum-smoothie-29911\" title=\"Plum Smoothie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plum Smoothie</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/rice-ball-34694\" title=\"Rice Ball\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rice Ball</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Plum.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033810\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Plum.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033810\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e6/Plum.png/revision/latest?cb=20240219033810\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plum\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 94\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 102\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 110\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 4 to 6 plums per crate, up to a total of 20 per boat.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Each tree gives a maximum of 13 plums in 4 days minimum, which gives players 4.76 coins per hour.</li>\n<li>Its selling price is same as <a href=\"/wiki/blackberry-2247\" title=\"Blackberry\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blackberry</a> but selling plum is more profitable because plum requires less time to harvest.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/apple-2241\" title=\"Apple (1.26 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7d/Apple.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219032402\" title=\"Apple (1.26 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Apple (1.26 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/banana-26401\" title=\"Banana (3.2 MB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/69/Banana.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219032506\" title=\"Banana (3.2 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Banana (3.2 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/blackberry-2247\" title=\"Blackberry (422 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/25/Blackberry.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20240219032632\" title=\"Blackberry (422 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Blackberry (422 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/blueberries-3