  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Plum.png|200px|left|Plum]]\n\n{{Infobox\n|title = [[Crops|Crop]]\n|level = 94\n|price = 1 to 82\n|time = 1 d 1 h\n|xp = 16\n|source = [[File:Plum Tree.png|50px|link=Plum Tree]]\n|base = 23\n|dia = 16}}\n'''Plums''' are fruit [[crops]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 94. They grow on [[Plum Tree|plum trees]] and can be harvested four times.\n\nThey were introduced on 25th June 2018.\n\nThey are used as ingredients for [[Plum Jam|plum jam]], [[Plum Smoothie|plum smoothies]], and [[Rice Ball|rice balls]]. \n\nLike all crops, they are stored in the [[silo]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Harvesting plums'''===\n[[File:Plum Tree.png|150px|left|link=Plum Tree|Plum tree]]\nThe first harvest gives two plums, the second one three, and the other two four. After the third harvest the tree wilts.\n\nTapping on the tree places a sign on it letting other players know the tree needs to be revived. Once it is, a last harvest can be done before the tree dies. A [[saw]] is then required to cut it.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling plums'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Plums can be sold or bought for a maximum price of 828 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 plums.\n* Buying a plum tree costs 600 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n* Given all 13 plums are collected during the four harvests, the batch can be sold for 1,076 {{Infoicon|coin}}, thus giving a profit of 476 {{Infoicon|coin}} per tree.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n=== '''Using plums''' ===\nPlums are used to make the following [[products]]:\n{{Item Usage|Plum\n|Plum Jam|3|94\n|Plum Smoothie|3|102\n|Rice Ball|1|110\n}}\n\n{{Clr}}----\n=== '''Boat orders''' ===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n[[Boat]] orders ask for 4 to 6 plums per crate, up to a total of 20 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n*Each tree gives a maximum of 13 plums in 4 days minimum, which gives players 4.76 coins per hour.\n*Its selling price is same as [[Blackberry]] but selling plum is more profitable because plum requires less time to harvest.\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Pflaume \n|fr = Prune\n|es = Ciruela\n|no = Plomme\n}}\n[[Category:Tree Crops]]",
  "wikitextHash": "199e2171c8cc544001aaf20b9958a9e361d01f2732dc6f661da86be165f83cd2"
